{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s face wore an expression not of this world.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If I had to compare it to something... yes... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">a shinigami.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">I won... I won!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">A total victory, won by avoiding the dangerous colors, reading Zahha's intentions, and holding to my resolve to the very end!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Not by luck. A victory by skill!</STYLE>
